  "body": "I'm working on an implementation for isolating code and noticed that the `window.top` is non-configurable. I'd like the ability to `null` it or make it opaque within an iframe even if the iframe is of the same origin. Has iframe feature/capabilities for nullable or opaque `window.top` come up in some way or is there a proposal that more closely aligns along those lines?\r\n\r\n**Update:**\r\n\r\nMaybe an expansion or addition of a Feature-policy?",
